Philips and Hue are trademarks of Koninklijke Philips N.V., used under
licence by Signify. This module is not made, endorsed or supported by
Philips or Signify; the names are used only to say which devices it
talks to.

The Hue bridge root CA is not included. A caller that wants the
certificate chain verified supplies it (TLSCheck.Roots).

Dependencies
------------

- The Go standard library (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright The Go Authors).

Test peers
----------

The nested test-only module interop/ is not part of the published
module. It runs, in Docker, diyHue (github.com/diyhue/diyHue; Apache-2.0),
an open-source Hue bridge emulator, from its published image. No diyHue
code is included in this repository.

Test data
---------

Every bridge ID, application key, client key, MAC address, device name,
model number, firmware version and address in the tests and examples is
a made-up demo value. Product and model names are the real names of
product kinds, chosen to exercise each kind.
